WEBVTT

00:08:57.103 --> 00:09:00.128
Nevieme rozprávať,
druhí nás nepočúvajú

00:09:00.138 --> 00:09:03.055
a prostredie je plné hluku
a zlej akustiky.

00:09:03.055 --> 00:09:06.500
Viackrát som to tu spomínal.

00:09:06.798 --> 00:09:08.432
Aký by bol svet,

00:09:08.432 --> 00:09:10.152
ak by náš prejav bol silný,

00:09:10.152 --> 00:09:12.208
ľudia by vedome počúvali

00:09:12.208 --> 00:09:15.602
a prostredie by bolo vhodné?

00:09:15.602 --> 00:09:18.585
Alebo, ešte silnejšie:

00:09:18.585 --> 00:09:19.932
Aký by bol tento svet,

00:09:19.932 --> 00:09:22.310
ak by sme zvuk tvorili vedome,

00:09:22.310 --> 00:09:24.343
vedome ho aj prijímali

00:09:24.343 --> 00:09:27.080
a vedome preň tvorili vhodné prostredie?

00:09:27.447 --> 00:09:30.671
Taký svet by znel krásne